# Bulk research corpus — 2.6 GB, reproducible from Binance public endpoints (see PLAN-018 R-4.2).
# Anchored to root: an unanchored "data/" also matches app/viglide/core/data, a real source package.
# "/data/*" (not "/data/") so git still traverses the directory — a negation pattern below can't
# re-include a file whose parent directory is itself excluded (a well-known gitignore limitation).
/data/*
# The checksum manifest is the one exception — ~50 KB, committed so a stranger can verify a
# re-download reproduces the corpus byte-for-byte (scripts/download_historical_data.py --from-manifest).
!/data/MANIFEST.tsv
# Local run artifacts.
/live-runs/
# PLAN-018 R-3: winners.json is now tracked, redacted and repo-relative, under params/ (CLAUDE.md
# §8 amended) — the private repo's history/audit mechanism, not a Secret Manager stand-in anymore.
# A stray root-level or elsewhere copy must still never be committed by accident.
/winners.json
/winners*.json
# PLAN-013 Task H: cumulative calibration trial registry -- not secret, but a local research
# artifact like winners.json, not a build output; kept out of version control until there's a
# principled reason to publish trial-count history.
research-trials.jsonl
# SENSITIVE — never commit (see PLAN-001 §9 Hygiene): rotate & remove this file.
Backup-codes-*.txt
